  "body": "Don't wait on this one - exceptional, low maintenance living in the heart of Orewa rarely hit the market in this condition. Whether you are looking for an effortless permanent sanctuary or a secure lock and leave weekender, this turn key apartment is ready for you to move in tomorrow.\r\n\r\nStep inside to an almost new, open plan kitchen, dining, and living zone built for modern, living. Both the lounge and master bedroom open seamlessly to a gorgeous, private, sheltered patio, your personal oasis for effortless entertaining and year round relaxation.\r\n\r\nUnmatched Convenience & Total Security:\r\n\r\n• Ultimate Peace Of Mind:  Secure gated entry ensures your home remains private and protected.\r\n\r\n• Park & Walk:  Two dedicated car parks sit directly outside your back door, but you’ll rarely need them.\r\n\r\n• Beach & Town At Your Doorstep:  A short, flat 400 metre (approx.) stroll places you on the golden sands of Orewa Beach. Cafes, top tier dining, medical centres, gyms, are all just minutes away, with bus stops and main routes immediately accessible.\r\n\r\nProperties combining this position, privacy, and condition do not sit on the market. The keys are ready, and these owners are motivated. Call me today to secure your private viewing before someone else.\r\n\r\nSee interactive features for this property on barfoot.co.nz. Click the \"View office website\" link at the bottom of this page.",
